d is the first Muslim person elected to the upper chamber. El-Sayed is an epidemiologist and the former health director for the city of Detroit. He beat Republican Mike Rogers for the hotly contested seat.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Peggy Flanagan of Minnesota &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-152349" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 5349;         --source-height: 3566;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5349x3566+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fce%2F9f%2F56f1741c4d41bd69981fe6ce0939%2Fgettyimages-2302915246.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5349x3566+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fce%2F9f%2F56f1741c4d41bd69981fe6ce0939%2Fgettyimages-2302915246.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5349x3566+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fce%2F9f%2F56f1741c4d41bd69981fe6ce0939%2Fgettyimages-2302915246.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5349x3566+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fce%2F9f%2F56f1741c4d41bd69981fe6ce0939%2Fgettyimages-2302915246.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5349x3566+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fce%2F9f%2F56f1741c4d41bd69981fe6ce0939%2Fgettyimages-2302915246.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5349x3566+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fce%2F9f%2F56f1741c4d41bd69981fe6ce0939%2Fgettyimages-2302915