      <title>Stephen Miller will replace Susie Wiles as Trump's chief of staff</title>
      <author>Danielle Kurtzleben </author>
      <link>https://www.npr.org/2026/11/06/nx-s1-6032795/stephen-miller-replace-susie-wiles-trumps-chief-of-staff</link>
